1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:09,700
At dusk, one lamp becomes a promise.

2
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:19,700
No one has to hold the road alone.

3
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:29,700
From quiet doorways, a company gathers.

4
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:39,700
Over the hills, courage travels on foot.

5
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:49,700
When the distant footsteps answer…

6
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:59,700
…we stand together.
